    food: ['Browse first: cliffrose, mountain mahogany, sagebrush and bitterbrush in the north; jojoba, fairy duster, catclaw, mesquite beans and buckwheat in the desert.', 'Forbs after rain (filaree, globemallow) pull deer onto open ground.', 'Burns 3 to 10 years old and juniper thinnings are feed factories.', 'Alfalfa fields along rivers draw every deer within 3 miles each evening.'],
